{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00036",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 6.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.33,
      "end_seconds": 13.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.05,
      "end_seconds": 21.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I mean, uh, doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.26,
      "end_seconds": 25.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.04,
      "end_seconds": 35.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, it's burning when I pass urine. I don't know what's causing it. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.72,
      "end_seconds": 37.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.51,
      "end_seconds": 49.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Right, it's been one week now. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.82,
      "end_seconds": 59.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "Okay. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.07,
      "end_seconds": 75.27,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "Drinking water helps a bit. I'd say a few times a day. A five out of ten, I suppose. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.25,
      "end_seconds": 81.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 81.77,
      "end_seconds": 88.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.25,
      "end_seconds": 90.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.69,
      "end_seconds": 97.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "I've had pain low in the tummy too, uh, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.66,
      "end_seconds": 100.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.78,
      "end_seconds": 104.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.17,
      "end_seconds": 107.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Mm. Has there been cloudy, smelly urine too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.94,
      "end_seconds": 111.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Yes, um, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 111.99,
      "end_seconds": 114.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.73,
      "end_seconds": 119.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any similar episode recently or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.2,
      "end_seconds": 132.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "No, no similar episode recently, no back pain. I was needing to go all the time at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.07,
      "end_seconds": 138.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Have you had any vaginal discharge, blood in the urine or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.97,
      "end_seconds": 144.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "No vaginal discharge, blood in the urine or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.98,
      "end_seconds": 147.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "What about vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.45,
      "end_seconds": 151.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I mean, not at all, no vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 152.97,
      "end_seconds": 158.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Hmm, um, actually, doctor, I did notice vomiting. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.52,
      "end_seconds": 165.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.82,
      "end_seconds": 173.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.03,
      "end_seconds": 176.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 177.51,
      "end_seconds": 184.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 109 over 68, pulse 72, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature 37.0."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.05,
      "end_seconds": 190.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Alright, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.01,
      "end_seconds": 197.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Diabetes, for two years. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.73,
      "end_seconds": 199.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.81,
      "end_seconds": 209.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid for five years now. I took the morning off to come in today. Yes, asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.73,
      "end_seconds": 221.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.62,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Yes, I can see the asthma in your file as well. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.9,
      "end_seconds": 225.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Um, my mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.87,
      "end_seconds": 230.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.78,
      "end_seconds": 233.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.25,
      "end_seconds": 239.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Alright, what medicines do you take regularly? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.05,
      "end_seconds": 245.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 246.33,
      "end_seconds": 255.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "Doctor, uh, I think the last prescription for the glimepiride was 4 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.93,
      "end_seconds": 260.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.07,
      "end_seconds": 270.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Okay, so no, I left it at home. Right, you know, I take Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.04,
      "end_seconds": 275.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.56,
      "end_seconds": 296.11,
      "duration_seconds": 19.55,
      "text": "Oh, not with me. I'll bring it next time. Right, I take Seretide inhaler, twice a day. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. Cranberry juice. I take it every day. Okay, so I was on metformin before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.97,
      "end_seconds": 298.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.99,
      "end_seconds": 305.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.91,
      "end_seconds": 307.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.37,
      "end_seconds": 312.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.69,
      "end_seconds": 315.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.0,
      "end_seconds": 320.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.96,
      "end_seconds": 325.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Right, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.34,
      "end_seconds": 329.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.02,
      "end_seconds": 345.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "There's mild tenderness above the pubic bone, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.47,
      "end_seconds": 370.91,
      "duration_seconds": 20.44,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with a urinary tract infection. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a kidney infection yet. I'd also keep a sexually transmitted infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.55,
      "end_seconds": 375.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I mean, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.5,
      "end_seconds": 386.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a urinary tract infection do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order a urine culture, for urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 388.14,
      "end_seconds": 393.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Doctor, I did a urine test before they came in, the result's on your screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.04,
      "end_seconds": 423.03,
      "duration_seconds": 28.99,
      "text": "Okay, thanks, I'll look at that. Let's use trimethoprim, 200 milligrams, twice a day, for three days. That should help with urine infection. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Drink plenty of water and don't hold it in when you need to go. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 423.61,
      "end_seconds": 431.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "I see. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.91,
      "end_seconds": 433.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.28,
      "end_seconds": 441.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you get a fever, back pain or vomiting. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.05,
      "end_seconds": 446.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Oh, uh, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 447.94,
      "end_seconds": 452.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again if it's not better in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.21,
      "end_seconds": 457.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Sure, um, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 458.93,
      "end_seconds": 462.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.47,
      "end_seconds": 467.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 468.08,
      "end_seconds": 470.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}